<title>USA: N.J. Development Authority repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>N.J. Development Authority repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. said Monday it repriced New Jersey Economic Development Authority's $52.3 million revenue bond deal, lowering yields five basis points on the current coupon portion.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
